tionsManager.java:240)\n```\n\nInternal cause exception is `io.netty.channel.ChannelException: too many channels (max: 10)`\n\nExpected behaviour, i think, listener should be called with failed future. Or at least exception should be clearer.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/30914092/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"valodzka","id":9821,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9821?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valodzka","html_url":"https://github.com/valodzka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valodzka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valodzka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valodzka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valodzka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valodzka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valodzka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valodzka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valodzka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valodzka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/30980520","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/2060#issuecomment-30980520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/2060","id":30980520,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMwOTgwNTIw","user":{"login":"trustin","id":173918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzkxOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin","html_url":"https://github.com/trustin","followers_url":"https://api.gith